{"unit_id":"huajuan2024__dsh-session-manager#card-zh","repo":"huajuan2024/dsh-session-manager","commit":"5b090802080ee56d01d80eb41c4f3cea6ede9c86","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-manager 是面向 DSH Desktop 与 Web 的会话管理插件，在设置页提供会话面板。它通过 Host 端 sessionQuery 读取会话，并以 Remote API 连接浏览器界面。用户可以按更新时间浏览会话摘要、展开查看历史、删除已停止的会话，也能将单条会话导出为 JSON 或 Markdown。历史读取支持分页上限，导出提供大小限制。适合需要在 DSH 设置中整理和留存会话记录的用户；需运行兼容版本的 DSH，无需额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-106","src/index.ts:247-335","src/client.ts:469-470"]}
{"unit_id":"huajuan2024__dsh-session-manager#card-en","repo":"huajuan2024/dsh-session-manager","commit":"5b090802080ee56d01d80eb41c4f3cea6ede9c86","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-manager adds a session panel to DSH settings. It lists and sorts sessions, shows message history, deletes stopped sessions, and exports a session as JSON or Markdown. History length and export size are configurable. It requires a compatible DSH host and no account or API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:87-106","src/index.ts:247-335","src/client.ts:469-470"]}
